{"id":10869,"date":"2024-08-14T16:27:33","date_gmt":"2024-08-14T16:27:33","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/?p=10869"},"modified":"2025-09-05T18:46:17","modified_gmt":"2025-09-05T18:46:17","slug":"top-25-general-contractors-in-portland","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/top-25-general-contractors-in-portland\/","title":{"rendered":"Top 25 General Contractors in Portland"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>&#8220;Top 25 General Contractors in Portland&#8221;<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/portrait-of-group-employees-in-the-warehouse-with-2024-04-10-16-50-30-utc-1024x683.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10912\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Your Top List for Portland General Contractors&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">In this article, we explore the diverse range of general contractors available for various types of projects, helping you understand the different specialties within the industry. Choosing the right contractor for your specific needs can be challenging, especially when considering the unique requirements of different types of construction and renovation work. To make this process easier, we have carefully curated a list of the top 25 general contractors in Portland, divided into five key categories: General Contractors, Kitchen and Bath Remodels, Commercial Construction, Custom Homes, and Emergency Restoration.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Each category showcases the top 5 contractors who excel in their respective fields, ensuring that no matter the scope or nature of your project, you can find a trusted professional to bring your vision to life. Whether you are planning a home renovation, constructing a custom home, or needing immediate assistance for emergency restoration, our guide will help you make an informed decision.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Categories Covered:<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ol class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>General Contractors:<\/strong> These professionals are versatile and experienced in handling a wide range of construction projects, from residential builds to large-scale renovations. We\u2019ve highlighted the top 5 general contractors in Portland known for their reliability, craftsmanship, and project management skills.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Commercial Construction:<\/strong> For businesses and large-scale projects, finding a contractor with experience in commercial construction is crucial. We\u2019ve identified the top 5 commercial contractors in Portland who are known for their ability to handle complex projects, meet deadlines, and maintain high standards of quality.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Kitchen and Bath Remodels:<\/strong> Specializing in one of the most important areas of your home, these contractors are experts in transforming kitchens and bathrooms. We\u2019ve selected the top 5 companies that excel in delivering beautiful, functional, and high-quality remodels tailored to your preferences.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Custom Homes:<\/strong> Building a custom home is a significant investment, and you need a contractor who can turn your dream into reality. We\u2019ve chosen the top 5 custom home builders in Portland who are renowned for their attention to detail, design excellence, and commitment to client satisfaction.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li><strong>Emergency Restoration:<\/strong> When disaster strikes, whether it\u2019s fire, water, or storm damage, you need a contractor who can respond quickly and effectively. Our list of the top 5 emergency restoration contractors in Portland highlights companies that are known for their rapid response times, expertise in restoration, and ability to minimize further damage.<\/li>\n<\/ol>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">With this comprehensive guide, you can confidently select the best general contractor for your next project, knowing you\u2019re choosing from the very best in Portland. Whether your needs are residential or commercial, large-scale or focused on specific areas like kitchen and bath remodels, our top 25 contractors are equipped to deliver exceptional results.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>** Disclaimer**&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How do we determine a \u201ctop\u201d or \u201cbest\u201d contractor?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">We have not worked with or had personal experience with each and every one of these contractors so our information is limited to reputation and being deeply rooted in the local construction industry, and of course also the internet. It is our humble opinion that these contractors are the top in their specialties based on these factors: <strong>Value<\/strong>, meaning we have contractors on various locations of the \u201ccost\u201d spectrum not just having the most expensive contractor of each field but really the contractors who provide a great service for the dollar amount they charge. <strong>Reputation<\/strong>, from local knowledge and experience as well as reviews\/testimonials found online. And lastly, the <strong>portfolio<\/strong> of their projects and company.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Top 25 Portland general contractors by their specialties:<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large is-resized\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1024\" height=\"576\" src=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/hsbanner2-1024x576.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-13745\" style=\"width:671px;height:auto\" srcset=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-content\/uploa