lock-heading\"><strong>Specialty Mentions:&nbsp;<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-23.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10908\" style=\"width:233px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Relevant Buildings \u2013<a href=\"https:\/\/westernoregonbuilders.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> <\/a><a href=\"https:\/\/www.relevantbuildings.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.relevantbuildings.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><em>4.6 stars \u2013 8 Google reviews<\/em><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Located: <\/strong>15901 S Park Pl Ct, Oregon City, OR 97045<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in: <\/strong>Container Homes<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/landobuilderscorp.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/08\/unnamed-24.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-10909\" style=\"width:387px;height:auto\"\/><\/figure>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Rolling Homes \u2013 413-657-2391 \u2013 <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wheelsonthehouse.com\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">https:\/\/www.wheelsonthehouse.com\/<\/a><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"><strong>Specializes in: <\/strong>Tiny Homes on Wheels<\/p>\n\n\n\n<hr class=\"wp-block-separator has-alpha-channel-opacity\"\/>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>Is it cheaper to be your own general contractor?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Unless you are a licensed general contractor, you should always hire a professional. This is because it can cost time, energy, and money when faced with problems that you\u2019re unable to resolve on your own. In some states, it may even be illegal to take on a construction project without a license.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>How much does a general contractor cost on a remodel?<\/strong><\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">The cost for hiring a general contractor will depend on different factors such as the rate of that business\/contractor, square footage, and materials. Rates can differ, but you can expect to pay between $22,000 and $170,000, again depending on your home\u2019s specific needs.&nbsp;Trust us to deliver exceptional results. <a href=\"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/contact-us-2\/\" title=\"\">Contact us today<\/a> to embark on this journey toward a revitalized home.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>&#8220;Top 25 General Contractors in Portland&#8221; Your Top List for Portland General Contractors&nbsp; In this article, we explore the diverse range of general contractors available for various types of projects, helping you understand the different specialties within the industry. Choosing the right contractor for your specific needs can be challenging, especially when considering the unique [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":10874,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_acf_changed":false,"footnotes":""},"categories":[31],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-10869","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-contractors-guides"],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/10869","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/harrisandsons.co\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=10869"}],"ver